"1.2.1": {"q": "SOLAS Training Manuals (LSA and FSS)", "cat": "S", "gp": "I", "p": 28, "b": "Core", "g": [["1.2.1-12", "", "Manuals and documents listed in these questions should be available on board in either hard copy or electronic form. They should be sighted by the Inspector. All obsolete publications should be removed or properly marked as ''Un- controlled''. The following manuals and documentation are on board, are valid and have been sighted:"], ["", "SOLAS:", "SOLAS Training Manuals should be available in crew mess rooms and must be ship specific. Fire Safety Training Manual\n-Solas II -2/11.2.3. Fire Safety Operational Booklet Solas II- 2/110.2. Both could be combined in a single document. LSA Training manual SOLAS III / 35"]]},
